# Switching which activity has the pill and which one Expanded shows
# (PS §3.1 Split/Expanded, §6.2 user pin; decision 006).

scenario: clicking the bubble expands the bubble's activity
start media
start timer                         -> Split top=timer bubble=media
bubble                              -> Expanded expanded=media
outside                             -> Split top=timer          # looking doesn't swap
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer  # the pill opens the top one

scenario: clicking the bubble while an alert covers it is an ordinary click
start media
start timer
alert song for=media                -> Alert
bubble                              -> Expanded expanded=media

scenario: promoting swaps the pill and the bubble
start media
start timer                         -> top=timer bubble=media
promote media                       -> Split top=media bubble=timer pinned=media
start meeting                       -> top=media                # a newer activity doesn't take the pill back
promote timer                       -> top=timer pinned=timer   # a new pick replaces the old one
promote nobody                      -> top=timer pinned=timer   # unknown ids are ignored

scenario: the pick beats relevance and Passive/Active, not more urgent levels
start media active 0.1
start download active 0.9
start sync passive 1.0
promote media                       -> top=media
start meeting timeSensitive         -> top=meeting bubble=media pinned=media
end meeting                         -> top=media

scenario: an urgent pick stays above others of its level
start call timeSensitive 0.1
start meeting timeSensitive 0.9     -> top=meeting
promote call                        -> top=call

scenario: the pick ends with its activity
start media
start timer
promote media                       -> top=media
end media                           -> Compact top=timer pinned=none
start media                         -> top=media pinned=none    # newest wins again, no stale pick

scenario: an expiring pick is cleared too
start media expires=5000
start timer
promote media                       -> pinned=media
wait 5000                           -> Compact top=timer pinned=none

scenario: the Expanded switcher pages through activities in rank order, wrapping
start a
start b
start c                             -> top=c
click                               -> Expanded expanded=c
page                                -> Expanded expanded=b
page                                -> expanded=a
page                                -> expanded=c
page -1                             -> expanded=a

scenario: paging keeps Expanded open like pointer movement
start a
start b
click
wait 7000
page                                -> Expanded expanded=a
wait 7000                           -> Expanded
wait 1000                           -> Split

scenario: promoting from Expanded keeps the card open on it
start media
start timer
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
page                                -> expanded=media
promote media                       -> Expanded expanded=media top=media
outside                             -> Split top=media bubble=timer

scenario: paging outside Expanded does nothing
start a
start b
page                                -> Split top=b
